            <ArticleTitle>Phentermine: an appetite-suppressant amphetamine classified as a narcotic in France. Is a combination with topiramate on the horizon?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>209</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In France, extra restrictions have been placed on this appetite-suppressant drug. Phentermine is widely used in many countries despite its multiple adverse effects and lack of proven efficacy in preventing complications of obesity.</AbstractText>
